# Accounting integrity

Post through the canonical engine/RPC. Posted data is immutable. Use storno
and linked replacement entries. Balance, period locks, numbering,
idempotency, audit and outbox effects belong inside the atomic database
boundary. Use `roundOre()` for money. Add pg-real coverage for triggers, RPCs,
RLS, concurrency and rollback.
